{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把反复确认说成了有意通过记忆和确认来留住幸福；原稿说的是他不自觉地确认自己正在享有幸福，并未明确说这是留住幸福的办法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把想重新回味欢喜但念头停在半途，概括成了不再追逐脑海中的欢喜。原稿仍然存在回味的冲动，只是没有顺着这个念头继续反复确认。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把原稿中夹着的一点酸楚说成了挥之不去的酸楚，程度略有加重；也没有充分呈现熟悉温存带着此前反复想留住它的重量。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 3,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲主线基本一致，但把开端害怕表达改变亲近的顾虑简化成了害怕失去，也弱化了中段超越个人得失的温柔，以及欢喜与悲伤交织到极处后的强烈情绪释放。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4ba1cc38-b779-4a2f-8ece-82752df9be12", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T130817097615Z", "elapsed_seconds": 174.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T13:11:11.258647+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_p